> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1189,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1854979,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1402611496,"LastPoster":{"Id":285220,"Name":"Valery","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1854979,"PostDate":1402611496,"PostContent":"Hi everyone so I'm waiting for Grand Coral to update their contract and resend it over to me and...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401122033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.136.194.145","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f208adef7ebfb159511323fe61d210a","RawContent":"Hi everyone so I&#039;m waiting for Grand Coral to update their contract and resend it over to me and I&#039;ll have my reception booked, have my accommodations booked, hair and makeup my own, flowers from DAC or similar, table set up Euphoria, dj taken care of, still need a wedding cake but for me I could totally make a boxed cake( yes I said that.)\n\n\nBut there is still one thing... An officiant! \n\n\nIf you google officiants you will see Noe Camacho. I tried reaching out to him multiple times with no luck. I found his Facebook site ( yes I&#039;m thorough, have planned many events for friends; I&#039;m crafty) he apologized said he was so busy n would contact me this week. Still nothing... At this point I have a bad feeling. If he&#039;s that busy now, will he make my day feel rushed? \n\n\nFor me the ceremony is the most important part. The emotion the intimacy the promise. Family encircled, feet rooted down onto the earth, no jewelry, no precessional music although I&#039;m planning something else instead, but the real raw union of two people for life. I want my officiant to understand that.\n\n\nIf any brides feel the same way then, who are you using to officiant your wedding?\n\n\nIt would be an English speaking symbolic ceremony. ( we are legally married but haven&#039;t exchanged vows.. We want this to feel real!)\n\n\nThanks!!!!!!!!!!\n\nLisa","Attachments":[],"Id":1854979,"PostDate":1402611496,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone so I'm waiting for Grand Coral to update their contract and resend it over to me and I'll have my reception booked, have my accommodations booked, hair and makeup my own, flowers from DAC or similar, table set up Euphoria, dj taken care of, still need a wedding cake but for me I could totally make a boxed cake( yes I said that.)<br><br>\nBut there is still one thing... An officiant! <br><br>\nIf you google officiants you will see Noe Camacho. I tried reaching out to him multiple times with no luck. I found his Facebook site ( yes I'm thorough, have planned many events for friends; I'm crafty) he apologized said he was so busy n would contact me this week. Still nothing... At this point I have a bad feeling. If he's that busy now, will he make my day feel rushed? <br><br>\nFor me the ceremony is the most important part. The emotion the intimacy the promise. Family encircled, feet rooted down onto the earth, no jewelry, no precessional music although I'm planning something else instead, but the real raw union of two people for life. I want my officiant to understand that.<br><br>\nIf any brides feel the same way then, who are you using to officiant your wedding?<br><br>\nIt would be an English speaking symbolic ceremony. ( we are legally married but haven't exchanged vows.. We want this to feel real!)<br><br>\nThanks!!!!!!!!!!<br>\nLisa\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401122033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.104.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f72bf41c49353379c320f1e0bc7c81ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi LisaAnthonyPoppy,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sounds like you are doing a lot of the leg work and planning the details on your own! Do you have a WC with the resort that can help you with this?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married in Cuba and honestly, most of the items you mentioned including the Officiant are things I have not even had to consider. Our wedding is in 9 days and our WC has taken care of everything.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our WC has arranged for a local Notary Public to officiate for us, we chose a legal non religious ceremony option. Not sure if this makes a difference on how easy\/difficult it is to find an officiant for or how much leg work the WC will do for you?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;d connect with the resort and ask them about it, it might be something they can help with and take some stress off of your plate. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864186,"PostDate":1407008494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi LisaAnthonyPoppy,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sounds like you are doing a lot of the leg work and planning the details on your own! Do you have a WC with the resort that can help you with this?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm getting married in Cuba and honestly, most of the items you mentioned including the Officiant are things I have not even had to consider. Our wedding is in 9 days and our WC has taken care of everything.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our WC has arranged for a local Notary Public to officiate for us, we chose a legal non religious ceremony option. Not sure if this makes a difference on how easy\/difficult it is to find an officiant for or how much leg work the WC will do for you?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'd connect with the resort and ask them about it, it might be something they can help with and take some stress off of your plate. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandie_blackman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"206.75.104.157","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406480197,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279185.jpg?_r=1408922571","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"081114OVCUBA","Id":279185,"Name":"081114OVCUBA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e566c6b7be89f12e43e777960ddbd27c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"LisaAnthonyPoppy\"] have you though of asking someone you know? A friend or family member? We do not want a religious ceremony and both think it would be nice if the officiant adds a personal touch and understands how important this day is to us. We are planning on asking my oldest brother. He is good at speaking in public, and will be officiating for one of his close friends at the end of the month I want to wait after that to ask him. I&#039;m French Canadian and FI is American, I would love to incorporate a few things in French in our ceremony and my brother is perfectly bilingual.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As you said and I totally agree, the ceremony is the most important part and the more I think about it I don&#039;t want a stranger we will never see again be the one to &#039;bless&#039; our union.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just a thought.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864189,"PostDate":1407009257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278120\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LisaAnthonyPoppy<\/span><\/a> have you though of asking someone you know? A friend or family member? We do not want a religious ceremony and both think it would be nice if the officiant adds a personal touch and understands how important this day is to us. We are planning on asking my oldest brother. He is good at speaking in public, and will be officiating for one of his close friends at the end of the month I want to wait after that to ask him. I'm French Canadian and FI is American, I would love to incorporate a few things in French in our ceremony and my brother is perfectly bilingual.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As you said and I totally agree, the ceremony is the most important part and the more I think about it I don't want a stranger we will never see again be the one to 'bless' our union.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just a thought.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406376249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.204.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77281,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 05 August 2014 - 12:19 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1407241170,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab229d79e72ee42d508dfbdb102366b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sounds like you&#039;ve done a great job with your wedding plans already, Lisa! Lillian84&#039;s idea also sounds wonderful - to have someone you know and who knows you and has a special relationship, sounds like a great fit :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find the perfect officiant for your Beautiful and Very Special Celebration!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s one of those magical intimate wedding \"moments that matter\" So Much that Linc captured at a recent wedding for added inspiration....enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10293675_10152529110044487_6699974990686978094_o.jpg\" alt=\"10293675_10152529110044487_6699974990686\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;if you want to see more, here&#039;s the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152529108049487.1073741902.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Grand Palladium Wedding Album link .&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you all the best with your plans - cheers!!! &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864617,"PostDate":1407241091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sounds like you've done a great job with your wedding plans already, Lisa! Lillian84's idea also sounds wonderful - to have someone you know and who knows you and has a special relationship, sounds like a great fit <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find the perfect officiant for your Beautiful and Very Special Celebration!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's one of those magical intimate wedding \"moments that matter\" So Much that Linc captured at a recent wedding for added inspiration....enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10293675_10152529110044487_6699974990686978094_o.jpg\" alt=\"10293675_10152529110044487_6699974990686\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>if you want to see more, here's the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152529108049487.1073741902.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Palladium Wedding Album link .<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best with your plans - cheers!!! \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.146.245.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5d20bd87536840cde5c3fda575b8191","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I highly recommand Gabriela de La rosa (&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px;\"&gt;gabydelarose@hotmail.com) from Promisses Spiritual Ceremonies (&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Promisses-Spiritual-Ceremonies\/332385010132246).&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Promisses-Spiritual-Ceremonies\/332385010132246).&lt;\/a&gt;She is the best officiant ever. I needed a bilingual person to perform our symbolic ceremony (french\/english) and everybody loved her. She made the ceremony so special and personal, She provided us with the sand ceremony kit with engraved vase as a gift.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898086,"PostDate":1433766639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I highly recommand Gabriela de La rosa (<span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\">gabydelarose@hotmail.com) from Promisses Spiritual Ceremonies (<\/span><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Promisses-Spiritual-Ceremonies\/332385010132246).' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...2385010132246).<\/a>She is the best officiant ever. I needed a bilingual person to perform our symbolic ceremony (french\/english) and everybody loved her. She made the ceremony so special and personal, She provided us with the sand ceremony kit with engraved vase as a gift.\u00a0 <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hdsamira@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.230.142.232","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1397779068,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"smird","Id":277638,"Name":"smird","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.42.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77281,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"052bdf83fa75607daca53009152bb333","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi girls.\n\nI can see this topic is now live anymore, but probably anybody can help me. Getting married in April 22nd in Playa del Secreto and trying to find wedding officiant netive english speaker for us. I cheked different web sites and there is rivieramayaofficiant.com who seem very responsible and good. i have read really positive reviews bout them at wedding wire. Anybody of you here used their services? I wanna try them, but just wanted to hear any more comments. here is their web page www.rivieramayaofficiant.com\n\nThank you&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907008,"PostDate":1446414871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi girls.<br>\nI can see this topic is now live anymore, but probably anybody can help me. Getting married in April 22nd in Playa del Secreto and trying to find wedding officiant netive english speaker for us. I cheked different web sites and there is rivieramayaofficiant.com who seem very responsible and good. i have read really positive reviews bout them at wedding wire. Anybody of you here used their services? I wanna try them, but just wanted to hear any more comments. here is their web page www.rivieramayaofficiant.com<br>\nThank you<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vasilisa.shanti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.42.23","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446412770,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Valery","Id":285220,"Name":"Valery","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77281","Title":"Wedding Officiant. Who Is Yours?","LastPostDate":1446414871},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
