{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":455,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1878609,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":266402,"Name":"chelseapaige37","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1416242906,"LastPoster":{"Id":285222,"Name":"devi009","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1907022,"PostDate":1446452612,"PostContent":"You can send thank you video greetings to your wedding guests, really loved it. I did it in Invit...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yamunadevi.j99@gmail.com","IpAddress":"183.82.4.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446451467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"devi009","Id":285222,"Name":"devi009","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.57.1","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78394,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe2176d854643dd790ac6cc9b048bcb1","RawContent":"I had envisioned doing a picture with us holding a thank you sign of sorts, but due to rain etc. we just never did it.\n\n\nI am hoping to get my pictures back this week and would like to send a photo to everyone with thank you cards. Any creative ideas? Should I just stick a picture in the card?\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1878609,"PostDate":1416242906,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I had envisioned doing a picture with us holding a thank you sign of sorts, but due to rain etc. we just never did it.<br><br>\nI am hoping to get my pictures back this week and would like to send a photo to everyone with thank you cards. Any creative ideas? Should I just stick a picture in the card?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelseapjohnson@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.72.57.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361480068,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chelseapaige37","Id":266402,"Name":"chelseapaige37","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78394,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 17 November 2014 - 05:30 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1416245437,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91532f5cc392133f4afeb79c1b36fa20","RawContent":"[quote name=\"chelseapaige37\" post=\"1878609\" timestamp=\"1416257306\"]\nI had envisioned doing a picture with us holding a thank you sign of sorts, but due to rain etc. we just never did it.\n\nI am hoping to get my pictures back this week and would like to send a photo to everyone with thank you cards. Any creative ideas? Should I just stick a picture in the card?\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]I&#039;ve seen it done both ways!\nIt&#039;s tough because if you send a picture printed onto a thank you card they can&#039;t frame it, but they can be so pretty :) \n\nNot sure what we will do yet but guess I should start thinking about it. \n\nThe wedding I attended last year had a picture in the thank you card. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1878610,"PostDate":1416245391,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>chelseapaige37, on 17 November 2014 - 04:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nI had envisioned doing a picture with us holding a thank you sign of sorts, but due to rain etc. we just never did it.<br><br>\nI am hoping to get my pictures back this week and would like to send a photo to everyone with thank you cards. Any creative ideas? Should I just stick a picture in the card?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI've seen it done both ways!<br>\nIt's tough because if you send a picture printed onto a thank you card they can't frame it, but they can be so pretty <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br>\nNot sure what we will do yet but guess I should start thinking about it. <br><br>\nThe wedding I attended last year had a picture in the thank you card. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78394,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e9421c5772fb7b498a17e2bca5dafc0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We did ours through Vistaprint. I did a folding card in a pattern that I liked that said \"Our Wedding\" on the front. Inside, on the right hand side I did our wedding details. I had a few sheets of one of our wedding photos printed at Walmart and just 2 side taped them inside the card. I think I did 2.5 x 3.5 size. It was easy to do. The thing is for us, we were just the two of us so there wasn&#039;t anyone to see us get married, which is why I just did \"Our Wedding\" on the outside. But you could very easily do \"Thank You\" and then just write a personal note on the inside. And they weren&#039;t super expensive either. Vistaprint has had a bunch of sales on over the last couple of weeks and have been sending me emails like crazy advertising all of the sale prices. They have some really nice cards too. You could even do a photo card if you want and write a short thank you note on the back, then just put it into an envelope to send. Just a couple of suggestions....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878621,"PostDate":1416258033,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We did ours through Vistaprint. I did a folding card in a pattern that I liked that said \"Our Wedding\" on the front. Inside, on the right hand side I did our wedding details. I had a few sheets of one of our wedding photos printed at Walmart and just 2 side taped them inside the card. I think I did 2.5 x 3.5 size. It was easy to do. The thing is for us, we were just the two of us so there wasn't anyone to see us get married, which is why I just did \"Our Wedding\" on the outside. But you could very easily do \"Thank You\" and then just write a personal note on the inside. And they weren't super expensive either. Vistaprint has had a bunch of sales on over the last couple of weeks and have been sending me emails like crazy advertising all of the sale prices. They have some really nice cards too. You could even do a photo card if you want and write a short thank you note on the back, then just put it into an envelope to send. Just a couple of suggestions....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1878621]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-232000-0-41678600-1416272009.jpg\" title=\"wedding card inside.jpg - Size: 8.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-232000-0-41678600-1416272009.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"wedding card inside.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1878621]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-232000-0-58776100-1416272011.jpg\" title=\"wedding card.jpg - Size: 26.57KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-232000-0-58776100-1416272011.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"wedding card.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"113.19.83.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78394,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd7cdf771f82baf72e91ecd150e809f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Good posting, like thank you card invitation card is very important. Marriage is the intimate union and equal partnership of a man and a woman. Marriage is a unique relationship different from all others. Generally, an invitation or notification sent out on the occasion of a marriage. Wedding card has also Essential role for wedding, so the theme of cards are selected according to tradition. At the time of my sister\u2019s marriage I contacted to Dream Wedding Card. They provided me amazing cards at affordable price.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906242,"PostDate":1444797234,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Good posting, like thank you card invitation card is very important. Marriage is the intimate union and equal partnership of a man and a woman. Marriage is a unique relationship different from all others. Generally, an invitation or notification sent out on the occasion of a marriage. Wedding card has also Essential role for wedding, so the theme of cards are selected according to tradition. At the time of my sister\u2019s marriage I contacted to Dream Wedding Card. They provided me amazing cards at affordable price.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dreamweddingcard90@gmail.com","IpAddress":"113.19.83.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439432081,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rahulsharma","Id":284395,"Name":"rahulsharma","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"183.82.4.225","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78394,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"465f644b12fc11b18dd0338b7ee0eea3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You can send thank you video greetings to your wedding guests, really loved it. I did it in Inviter platform(&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/inviter.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/inviter.com&lt;\/a&gt;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907022,"PostDate":1446452612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You can send thank you video greetings to your wedding guests, really loved it. I did it in Inviter platform(<a href='http:\/\/inviter.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/inviter.com<\/a>)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yamunadevi.j99@gmail.com","IpAddress":"183.82.4.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446451467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"devi009","Id":285222,"Name":"devi009","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78394","Title":"Thank You Cards","LastPostDate":1446452612},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
