unately, it was too late to be able to return them to the seller. I bought one with a mint lining and one with a gold lining. I will sell them for $35each, shipping included for those in the U.S. Let me know :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/227429901\/mint-wedding-clutch-mint-and-peach?ref=favs_view_22&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/227429901\/mint-wedding-clutch-mint-and-peach?ref=favs_view_22&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906619,"PostDate":1445337531,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! I purchased these clutches for my bridesmaids but decided I liked something else a little better... unfortunately, it was too late to be able to return them to the seller. I bought one with a mint lining and one with a gold lining. I will sell them for $35each, shipping included for those in the U.S. Let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/227429901\/mint-wedding-clutch-mint-and-peach?ref=favs_view_22' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ef=favs_view_22<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397425622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79668","Title":"Cute Clutches For Sale","LastPostDate":1445337531},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
