ce04632","RawContent":"Congratulations!!!\n\nI&#039;m getting married at Secrets Maroma Beach in October of this year :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1856927,"PostDate":1403719111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations!!!<br>\nI'm getting married at Secrets Maroma Beach in October of this year <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rvalenka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.12.120","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383887354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274900.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rvalenka","Id":274900,"Name":"rvalenka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.250.235.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3904ca36950bb42d9c78fd7a71371134","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;April 2015 :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where did you get the group rate? Was it through the resort directly? Or through travel agent?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857108,"PostDate":1403820322,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>April 2015 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Where did you get the group rate? Was it through the resort directly? Or through travel agent?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sugagingin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.250.235.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403819151,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ginnyc","Id":278720,"Name":"ginnyc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0ba20c9402ae0296416db7a5dc0af4f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh spill please!! I didn&#039;t know Secrets was opening a new resort!! Details! We need details!! Where are you travelling from for your group rate? US or Canadian? When does it open???&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857162,"PostDate":1403865426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh spill please!! I didn't know Secrets was opening a new resort!! Details! We need details!! Where are you travelling from for your group rate? US or Canadian? When does it open???<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"856a7655b4993bd12fcff02efacddfdb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats!! LOVE PLaya Mujeres! I got engaged there!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857342,"PostDate":1404035777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats!! LOVE PLaya Mujeres! I got engaged there!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391602956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.53.98.96","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e813f8f375ad8d05032d52c79e7974ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey thanks everyone!! I got my group rate from a travel agent in Canada.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know what the beaches are like in Playa Mujeres?? Are they similar to Cancun with the beautiful blue water?&amp;nbsp; Calm ocean?&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;We are travelling May 3-10 and the resort opens in Nov 2014.&amp;nbsp; Here is a link to view the property&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.secretsresorts.com\/playa-mujeres&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.secretsresorts.com\/playa-mujeres&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It should be beautiful.&amp;nbsp; Every room is an ocean view suite or swim out suit.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857655,"PostDate":1404166931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey thanks everyone!! I got my group rate from a travel agent in Canada.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Does anyone know what the beaches are like in Playa Mujeres?? Are they similar to Cancun with the beautiful blue water?\u00a0 Calm ocean?<\/p>\n<br \/><p>We are travelling May 3-10 and the resort opens in Nov 2014.\u00a0 Here is a link to view the property<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.secretsresorts.com\/playa-mujeres' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.secretsre...m\/playa-mujeres<\/a><\/p>\n<p>It should be beautiful.\u00a0 Every room is an ocean view suite or swim out suit.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megwade@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.53.98.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401220846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278140.jpg?_r=1401242002","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":216,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megwade","Id":278140,"Name":"megwade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.94.125.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b507cadedd0bfd79dc2cabcc22d9fe32","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married at excellence playa mujeres next door and from what I&#039;ve read there can be a lot of sea grass at times \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1857738,"PostDate":1404222944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married at excellence playa mujeres next door and from what I've read there can be a lot of sea grass at times <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397422022,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.53.129.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ede0e999b1cfc34c63432d7c13fea8a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;How exciting for you megwade - Congrats!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a photo of the beach at the Beloved Hotel Playa Mujeres......with more at the album link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152140955769487.1073741875.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Beloved Hotel Playa Mujeres Wedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-sea.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t1.0-9\/1606881_10152140959134487_1607593742_n.jpg\" alt=\"1606881_10152140959134487_1607593742_n.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Agreed - Secrets Resorts are Amazing..... as seen here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152364714344487.1073741887.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Secrets Maroma Spa Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt; ....with photo excerpt here....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-sea.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/10151173_10152364720224487_8201575915750113126_n.jpg\" alt=\"10151173_10152364720224487_8201575915750\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy research....hope you find the Perfect one for both of you - cheers! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857770,"PostDate":1404229481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>How exciting for you megwade - Congrats!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a photo of the beach at the Beloved Hotel Playa Mujeres......with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152140955769487.1073741875.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Beloved Hotel Playa Mujeres Wedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-sea.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t1.0-9\/1606881_10152140959134487_1607593742_n.jpg\" alt=\"1606881_10152140959134487_1607593742_n.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Agreed - Secrets Resorts are Amazing..... as seen here:<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152364714344487.1073741887.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Secrets Maroma Spa Wedding Album<\/a> ....with photo excerpt here....<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-sea.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t1.0-9\/10151173_10152364720224487_8201575915750113126_n.jpg\" alt=\"10151173_10152364720224487_8201575915750\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy research....hope you find the Perfect one for both of you - cheers! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.62.112.229","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLi